<!-- Menu style ElDewrito (online): the SERVER BROWSER, Halo Online's way (our own art and layout): the
title large at the top left, the count at the right; the networks as tabs - ONLINE, SYSTEM LINK, AD HOC,
L and R change them (the connection itself, as HOST SETTINGS and the settings panel's Connection set
it: menu_functions.c online_browser_network_step) -; under them, on ONLINE, the filters - ALL, VITA, PC,
SERVERS (dedicated servers), BOTS (games with bots) -, the D-pad's left and right; the columns' header,
the games (the LAN browser's rows, h3/lan: the System Link list's and, Online, the public games), and at
the right the chosen game's card - its map's picture, its name, what it plays, its players and rules -;
the hints at the foot. It stands for h3/lan/screen (menu_tags.c: online/ for h3/) with the same
functions ("port h3 lan ...", "port browser ..."). -->
